                            "html": "<p>Join the specialty food community to kick off 2027 in one of the world's great food cities: San Francisco. Elevate your trade show experience with offsite sampling, unstructured networking, and local immersion.</p><p><strong>January 17–19 in San Francisco, CA</strong></p>"
